{
  "name": "s1ntr",
  "version": "2.5.0",
  "description": "S1NTR \u2014 a creative-coding studio that codes art across many visual and audio mediums and fuses them into one layered work, then keeps the kiln burning: every artifact, failure, preference and repair is fused back into its next firing (to sinter: fuse many particles into one solid form with heat and pressure, the way a kiln fuses clay)",
